{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24020","headline":"赠晦叔忆梦得 · 白居易","name":"赠晦叔忆梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自别崔公四五秋，因何临老转风流。\n归来不说秦中事，歇定唯谋洛下游。\n酒面浮花应是喜，歌眉歛黛不关愁。\n得君更有无厌意，犹恨尊前欠老刘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}